 outcome data were available.", "expertPrediction": "yes", "gptExplanation": "The inclusion of a placebo group in the study design and the statement about avoiding study bias based on previous studies suggest that there was a pre-specified analysis plan finalized before unblinded outcome data were available.", "gptPrediction": "yes", "gptResponse": "{
