lidated for use in children from I to 18 yr."", "ctxParagraph2Feedback": null, "ctxParagraph3": "There was no significant difference between groups with respect to Maunuksela pain scores (Table 2 ).", "ctxParagraph3Feedback": null, "domain_number": 5, "expertExplanation": "The study specifically mentions the use of the Maunuksela pain scale for pain assessment in small children. There is no indication that other outcome measurements within the pain domain were considered or used in this study.", "expertPrediction": "no", "gptExplanation": "The study specifically mentions the use of the Maunuksela pain scale for pain assessment in small children. There is no indication that other outcome measurements within the pain domain were considered or used in this study.", "gptPrediction": "no", "gptResponse": "{ 
