ta processing and statistical tests were specified beforehand, and the level of significance was also clearly stated. Therefore, it is unlikely that the numerical result was selected from multiple eligible analyses of the data.", "expertPrediction": "no", "gptExplanation": "The study design was randomized and double-blind, with a clear protocol for data analysis. The data processing and statistical tests were specified beforehand, and the level of significance was also clearly stated. Therefore, it is unlikely that the numerical result was selected from multiple eligible analyses of the data.", "gptPrediction": "no", "gptResponse": "{
