ion provided in the given context regarding whether the data analysis was done according to a pre-specified plan or not. Hence, it is not possible to determine if the data were analyzed in accordance with a pre-specified analysis plan before unblinded outcome data were available.", "gptPrediction": "no", "gptResponse": "{
