n_number": 5, "expertExplanation": "The primary outcome measure was clearly defined and specified in the study design and protocol. No mention of multiple eligible outcome measurements within the outcome domain was made. Results were all reported in accordance with the pre-specified outcome domains.", "expertPrediction": "probably no", "gptExplanation": "The primary outcome measure was clearly defined and specified in the study design and protocol. No mention of multiple eligible outcome measurements within the outcome domain was made.", "gptPrediction": "no", "gptResponse": "{ 
